		(uuid "1da405b3-d53b-4a69-b967-71c356e5ff50")
	)
	(text_box "The AT24CS04 in this design is an external I2C EEPROM used by the USB2244 to store its configuration data. C'est là où on enregistre par exemple le nom de la clé usb\n "
